<title>SOUTH AFRICA: HARTEBEESTFONTEIN DETAILS GOLD HEDGING.</title>
<headline>HARTEBEESTFONTEIN DETAILS GOLD HEDGING.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglovaal Ltd said</p>
<p>on Tuesday its Hartebeestfontein Gold Mining Co Ltd had made the</p>
<p>following sales of future production as at September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>    Year ending    Kg of gold sold    Ave forward price - R/kg</p>
<p>    June 30 1997	1,821		  54,462</p>
<p>    June 30 1998	  132		  57,974</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482 1003</p>
</text>
